      "status": "candidate",
      "text": "*************************************************************\nStargod (Zaccaria 1980) RetroRitchie MOD\nOriginal table by Goldchicco / 32Assassin\nvp9 table by: Ezepov\nOriginal table DOF calls enhanced by Arngrim\nsorry if i missed anyone!\nThanks to: VPW for the tutorials and example Table\nMovieguru for upscaled PF imagery\nFluffhead35 and Wylte for some great tips and guidance earlier on.\nPinstratsDan, @DGrimmReaper, Cliffy, StudlyGoorite, Apophis, Bord, Rajo Joey, Darth Vito, somatik, Rothbauerw. BountyBob for testing\nApophis, Bord, TastyWasps, Sixtoe for general advice and help\nHauntfreaks for the updated backglass and some lighting tips\nEveryone in VPW\nRajo Joey for the English Apron\nTomate for tips and sharing his Godzilla Blender file\nROM SETTINGS\nLots of options, see the following link for 'how to' https://www.vpforums.org/index.php?app=tutorials&article=130\nAlternative NVRam available:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1JW1KdDx-qtwcTB73MzlF5z9zGfqFqPVB\n3 ball game, normal advancement of 'GOD' (starts with G), extra ball on lit top special hit (special is lit after the top drop bank if downed 3x times), high score saved\n**********************************************************************************************************"
